# Project Structure Overview

## Repos and Roots
- crm-deployment/ (Frappe app: published to Frappe Cloud)
- frappe-bench/ (local bench; SPA under apps/crm/frontend)
- assistant/executive-ai-assistant-main/farfalle-main (chatbot)

## Frappe App (crm-deployment/crm)
- hooks.py: routes, desk/client JS, scheduler, overrides
- api/: backend endpoints (etl, doc, email, agent, settings, session)
- fcrm/doctype/: CRM DocTypes (Lead, Deal, Organization, etc.)
- fcrm/workspace/: Workspaces and sidebar shortcuts
- public/js/: client JS (ai_actions.js)
- www/: server-rendered pages (upload_leads, human_inbox)

## SPA (frappe-bench/apps/crm/frontend)
- src/pages/Leads.vue: list + Upload CSV modal
- src/components/Modals/LeadsUploadModal.vue: ETL flow
- src/router.js: routes under /crm

## Chatbot (farfalle-main)
- Orchestrator, tools, adapters; acts like Perplexity-style chat

## Key Data Flows
- CSV ETL: upload_leads → crm.api.etl → Lead/Org/Contact upsert
- AI Email: form AI buttons → crm.api.agent.run → crm.api.email
- Human Inbox: list and send AI drafts